  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::EndSceneManager
  characterNameText: {fileID: 119138959}
  birthYearText: {fileID: 1373578475}
  descriptionText: {fileID: 262842950}
  quitButton: {fileID: 1373852919}
  maleDescription: Ham hock pancetta flank ham tenderloin chuck, spare ribs strip
    steak frankfurter. Burgdoggen strip steak t-bone meatball venison. Tenderloin
    cupim sirloin jowl, filet mignon pork belly ball tip ham tail shoulder picanha
    turducken ham hock chicken shankle. Bresaola pork strip steak landjaeger short
    ribs filet mignon. Tri-tip turkey meatball porchetta. Pancetta pork belly prosciutto,
    biltong beef ribs tri-tip bresaola capicola flank sausage. Biltong boudin sausage
    corned beef chuck pig tri-tip burgdoggen t-bone turkey filet mignon.
  femaleDescription: 'It is a long established fact that a reader will be distracted
    by the readable content of a page when looking at its layout. The point of using
    Lorem Ipsum is that it has a more-or-less normal distribution of letters, as
    opposed to using ''Content here, content here'', making it look like readable
    English. Many desktop publishing packages and web page editors now use Lorem
    Ipsum as their default model text, and a search for ''lorem ipsum'' will uncover
    many web sites still in their infancy. Various versions have evolved over the
    years, sometimes by accident, sometimes on purpose (injected humour and the like).



'
